{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And your eyes shall not spare your vessels.</b> Because he knew about his father, that he was exacting about his vessels and sparing of them, as they said: ״ויותר יעקב לבדו״ — that Jacob went back alone for small jars — therefore he warned them about this. Thus explains the Rav Yaakov, of blessed memory."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:07.395082919Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}